key BKSL \ |
key AC01 a A å Å caps
key AC02 o O ø Ø caps
key AC03 e E æ Æ caps
key AC04 u U é É caps
key AC05 i I caps
key AC06 d D ð Ð caps
key AC07 h H dead_acute caps
key AC08 t T þ Þ caps
key AC09 n N ñ Ñ caps
key AC10 s S ß ẞ caps
key AC11 - _ ­ – type=FOUR_LEVEL_ALPHABETIC
key LSGT < > | ¦
key AB01 '''' " dead_acute dead_doubleacute
key AB02 q Q caps
key AB03 j J caps
key AB04 k K caps
key AB05 x X caps
